    {
      "id": "F0",
      "statement": "Scope: this is one bounded replay (run run:72cf0e4b91a3, 55 dataset events, 3/3 jobs completed, clink exit status 0, not cancelled; fan-in threshold 5 distinct senders per 3,600,000 ms event-time window; onward max gap 1,800,000 ms). The graph holds 55 transfers, 48 accounts, 35 devices, 14 onward links and exactly 2 fan-in alerts. Everything below holds only for this dataset as this run processed it.",
