        "E13",
        "E14",
        "E15",
        "E16",
        "E17",
        "E18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F3",
      "statement": "Alert 1's onward route: all 6 contributing transfers have onward links. T0002, T0003 and T0006 link to T0007 (A-9278 to A-5092, 138000), which links to T0008 (A-5092 to A-2897, 135000), which links to T0009 (A-2897 to A-4989, 132000). T0010, T0011 and T0012 link to T0014 (A-9278 to A-5092, 210000), then T0015 (A-5092 to A-2897, 206000), then T0016 (A-2897 to A-4989, 202000). Chains are at most 3 onward links long. Both final transfers, T0009 and T0016, were not passed on, so the money comes to rest at A-4989. The route accounts are A-9278, A-5092, A-2897 and A-4989.",
      "claim_ids": [
