      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F4",
      "statement": "Alert 2's onward route: only 3 of the 6 contributing transfers (T0038, T0039, T0040) link onward, all to a single transfer, T0041 (A-9895 to A-1415, 14000). T0041 was not passed on. T0035, T0036 and T0037 were not passed on either, so in the recorded links those credits stay at A-9895. Chains are at most 1 onward link long. The chain ends are A-1415 and A-9895, and the route accounts are A-9895 and A-1415. A-1415 later sent T0055 (90000 to A-9514, at 1794333900000), but no onward link connects it to T0041, because T0055 falls well outside the 1,800,000 ms gap.",
