    {
      "id": "F5",
      "statement": "Shared devices on routes, alert 1: device D-568 was used to send every onward transfer on the route, T0007, T0008, T0009, T0014, T0015 and T0016. That means route accounts A-9278, A-5092 and A-2897 all sent from D-568. A-4989 sent no transfers in the dataset.",
