  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "id": "H1",
      "statement": "Alert 1 may be a collection-and-layering pattern: funds gathered at A-9278 and moved quickly through A-5092 and A-2897 to A-4989. If so, the single device D-568 on every hop could mean the three route accounts are operated by one party. The data does not establish this. A shared device is not proof of shared ownership, identity or fraud.",
